{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02933","headline":"直中书省 · 韦承庆","name":"直中书省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清切凤皇池，扶疎鸡树枝。\n唯应集鸾鹭，何爲宿羁雌。\n大造乾坤辟，深恩雨露垂。\n昆蚑皆含养，驽骀亦驱驰。\n木偶翻爲用，芝泥忽滥窥。\n九思空自勉，五字本无施。\n徒喜逢千载，何阶荅二仪。\n萤光向日尽，蚊力负山疲。\n禁宇庭除阔，闲宵钟箭移。\n暗花临户发，残月下帘欹。\n白发随年改，丹心爲主披。\n命将时共泰，言与行俱危。\n寄谢巢由客，尧年正在斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦承庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}